{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "おづっきゅーーん🔫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mob4maTEf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちはこんばんは\n小津玲奈です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもと挨拶が違うのです\n気がついたかな？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お久しぶりになってしまって\n書きたいことがたくさんあるので\nテンポよく行きたいと思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⚫︎乃木坂スター誕生！SIX"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ヨルシカさんの「ヒッチコック」を\n歌わせていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この曲は私の心の内にしまっている\nネガティブな部分を\nそのまま表したような歌詞の内容となっていて\n聴くたびに感情移入をしてしまい\n泣いていたのですが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回泣くことなく歌い切ることが出来て\nホッとしました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1年ぶりのソロ歌唱\n緊張した〜〜〜〜〜！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本番前あかりに背中を叩いてもらい\n気合は十分‼️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "震えは止まらなかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "放送を見ると手が震えているのがわかっちゃう🙌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1年前、菅田将暉さんの「さよならエレジー」\nを歌わせていただいた時は"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "休業直前のタイミングで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "休業する不安や後ろめたさを\n強引に吹き飛ばしたい一心で"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とにかく自分を強く見せようとしていました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人に弱さを見せたくなくて\n周りの人に対しても心を閉ざしていたなぁと\n今になって思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あれから1年"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今ではだんだんと\n自分の弱さを受け入れてきて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同期や先輩に甘えることが増えてきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たのしいね、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてそして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなと一緒に\n安室奈美恵さんの「GIRL TALK」を\n披露させていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リズムを取ることが難しく\n尚且つ\n踊りながら歌う\nという難易度がとても高い楽曲でしたが\n挑戦させていただけて嬉しかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "普段はあまり着ることのない\nかっこいい系の衣装も嬉しかったな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobz8v9wP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来週はなんと小林幸子さんと\nご一緒させていただきます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私にとっては\nゲストの方との歌唱が初めてだったので\nより一層緊張しました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Huluでも観ることができるので\nぜひご覧ください！\nhttps://www.hulu.jp/nogizaka-star-is-born"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⚫︎らじらー！サンデー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "らじらー！サンデーさんに\n出演させていただきました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めての生放送ラジオ！！！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっても緊張したけれど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "スタッフの皆さんも\n藤森さん、村上さんのお二方も\n川﨑さんも\n本当に優しくて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とても楽しい時間を過ごさせていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昔からラジオを聴いていたので\nラジオの現場に入らせていただいていることに\n終始大感動していました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "放送が始まると\nブースの上が本当に"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "💡ON AIR💡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "と光るんだね！！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あとやっぱり\nラジオリスナーさんってみんな面白い！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハガキ職人さんに憧れ\nメールを送ろうとして\n何度挫折をしたことか、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "必殺技\nどれも素敵で選びきれなかったです\n全部習得したいなぁ😁"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おづっきゅーん🔫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんが元気になるといいな！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "聞き逃し配信を今週中聴くことができるので\nぜひお聴きください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://www.nhk.jp/p/radirer/rs/88W859PYQ9/"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⚫︎42枚目シングル"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "42枚目シングル「是非に及ばず」の\n情報が解禁されました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は今回アンダーメンバーとして参加させて\nいただきます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めて先輩方と一緒に\n本格的にシングル期間の活動ができることを\nとても嬉しく思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは全国ツアー！\n初めてのことが多くまだ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "緊張　＞　楽しみ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "の状態ではありますが精一杯頑張ります！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんと！！今回から\nやっっっっっっと\nミーグリに参加させていただきます！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しい！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41枚目シングル期間は\nみんながミーグリをしている間\n1人お留守番をしていて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木メでミーグリ風動画を送ったり\n何をお話ししようか1人で考えたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はやくファンの皆さんにお会いしたいなぁと\nずっと思っていました😊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またファンの皆さんとお話しできることが\nとってもとっても楽しみです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分に任された場所を\n精一杯努めたいと思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからもよろしくお願いします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "涙で人は強くはならないけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その分笑顔の花は大きく咲くよね🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobu1hPbU.jpg", "alt": ""}], "source": "official"}